# Base URL of the Indwella FastAPI backend (no trailing slash).
#
# Leave API_BASE_URL commented out for simulator/emulator work: apiClient.ts
# already falls back to the right host per platform
#   - Android emulator -> http://10.0.2.2:8000  (alias for the host's localhost)
#   - iOS simulator    -> http://localhost:8000 (shares the host network stack)
#
# Setting it to a single value breaks one of the two platforms, so only set it
# when you want to override both - e.g. a LAN IP for testing on real devices,
# or a deployed environment.
#
# Note: iOS ATS blocks plain http:// to arbitrary hosts. localhost is exempt,
# but an http:// LAN IP needs an NSExceptionDomains entry in Info.plist.
# API_BASE_URL=http://192.168.1.20:8000
